{
  "_doc": [
    "Training data recipe — 'Broad Brain' mix.",
    "",
    "Goal: extend MindeesAI from voice-only to actually-useful coverage of",
    "code, math, reasoning, and chat — while keeping the persona on top via",
    "the existing --corpus and --distill-corpus weights.",
    "",
    "How to use:",
    "  bash scripts/train/run-home-max.sh \\",
    "    --resume \\",
    "    --variant home-max \\",
    "    --batch 1 --grad-accum 8 --no-compile --no-grad-ckpt \\",
    "    --mix-config scripts/data/mix-broadbrain.json",
    "",
    "  (Drop the old --dialogue-dataset / --hf-dataset flags when using",
    "   --mix-config — TinyStories and Dolly are included in the recipe.)",
    "",
    "Trade-off note on data sources:",
    "  Some entries below (MetaMathQA, UltraChat) are synthetic — generated by",
    "  larger LLMs. Training small models on them is the standard 'distillation'",
    "  recipe (Phi-3, DeepSeek-V3, every modern <1B model uses it). If you want",
    "  ZERO synthetic data, remove those entries; you'll lose ~30% of capability",
    "  coverage but the model will only learn from human-written text.",
    "",
    "Effective sampling probabilities (total weight = 18.5):",
    "  distill        21.6%  (your chat voice — highest priority)",
    "  dolly          16.2%  (human-written instructions)",
    "  code-alpaca    10.8%  (code instructions)",
    "  metamath       10.8%  (math, synthetic)",
    "  open-platypus  10.8%  (STEM reasoning)",
    "  the-stack       8.1%  (real Python code)",
    "  ultrachat       8.1%  (multi-turn chat, synthetic)",
    "  tinystories     8.1%  (narrative warmup)",
    "  base-corpus     5.4%  (seed corpus)"
  ],

  "sources": [
    {
      "name": "tinystories",
      "dataset": "roneneldan/TinyStories",
      "split": "train",
      "kind": "raw",
      "max_tokens": 500000,
      "weight": 1.5,
      "note": "Narrative warmup. Tiny clean English."
    },
    {
      "name": "dolly",
      "dataset": "databricks/databricks-dolly-15k",
      "split": "train",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "max_tokens": 1500000,
      "weight": 3.0,
      "note": "Human-written instructions + responses. Quality > quantity."
    },
    {
      "name": "the-stack",
      "dataset": "bigcode/the-stack-smol",
      "config": "data/python",
      "split": "train",
      "kind": "raw",
      "max_tokens": 5000000,
      "weight": 1.5,
      "note": "Real Python from public GitHub. Pure code, no instructions."
    },
    {
      "name": "code-alpaca",
      "dataset": "sahil2801/CodeAlpaca-20k",
      "split": "train",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "max_tokens": 1000000,
      "weight": 2.0,
      "note": "Code instructions ('write a function that…') in alpaca format."
    },
    {
      "name": "metamath",
      "dataset": "meta-math/MetaMathQA",
      "split": "train",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "max_tokens": 3000000,
      "weight": 2.0,
      "note": "395k math word problems with worked CoT solutions. Synthetic."
    },
    {
      "name": "open-platypus",
      "dataset": "garage-bAInd/Open-Platypus",
      "split": "train",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "max_tokens": 2000000,
      "weight": 2.0,
      "note": "STEM reasoning, logic, science. Curated from many sources."
    },
    {
      "name": "ultrachat",
      "dataset": "HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k",
      "split": "train_sft",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "max_tokens": 5000000,
      "weight": 1.5,
      "note": "Multi-turn chat. Diverse topics. Synthetic (ChatGPT-generated)."
    }
  ]
}
